@startuml RF33_Sequencia
title RF33 — Passarela 3D: o Look do Dia de cada usuário desfilando num manequim\nDiagrama de sequência — GET /api/explorer/runway com HypeScore v2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor Pessoa as U
participant "explorer/page.tsx\n→ RunwayPanel" as FE
participant "LookbookController\nMirrorController" as LC
participant "ShowcaseController" as C
participant "ShowcaseService" as S
participant "DailyLookService" as DLS
participant "SchemeService" as SCH
participant "Avatar3dService" as AV
participant "HypeScoreCurrentRepository" as HR
database "MySQL" as DB
== Antes do desfile: o Look do Dia vira sinal de Hype ==
U -> FE: marca o Look do Dia (Lookbook, Espelho, Copilot, Autopiloto)
FE -> LC: POST /api/me/daily-look {schemeId} · POST /api/me/mirror/use
LC -> DLS: register(user, scheme, source, hoje)
alt alguma peça do look indisponível (RF33.CA05)
  DLS --> LC: 409 PECA_INDISPONIVEL
  LC --> FE: 409
else
  DLS -> DB: UPSERT daily_looks (1 por pessoa e dia; troca o esquema se já havia)
  DLS ->> DLS: DomainEvents.DailyLookRegistered (AFTER_COMMIT)
end
note over DLS, HR: HypeSignalRecorder grava o sinal LOOK_WORN; HypeLiveRecalc marca "sujo" e\nrecalcula; o job HypeSnapshotService (6/6 h) grava hype_scores
== Abrir a Passarela 3D ==
U -> FE: aba "Passarela 3D", ranking e filtros
FE -> C: GET /api/explorer/runway?ranking=TOP100_REGIONAL&region=EUROPA\n&colors=preto&occasions=&styles=&sex=&limit=12&offset=0
C -> S: runway(viewer, RunwayFilter)
S -> DB: SELECT daily_looks WHERE look_date >= hoje − 7
loop cada pessoa com look na semana
  S -> DLS: today(userId)
  DLS -> DB: copia o último look (materializedFrom)\nse não há registro de hoje e o esquema não é ARCHIVED
end
alt ranking fora de RUNWAY_RANKINGS
  S --> C: 400 RANKING_INVALIDO
  C --> FE: 400
else ranking = SEGUINDO e sem login
  S --> C: 401 (entrar para ver)
  C --> FE: 401
else ok
  S -> DB: SELECT daily_looks WHERE look_date = hoje\n(JOIN users, schemes, scheme_items, wardrobe_items)
  S -> SCH: canView(viewer, scheme) — filtra conta ACTIVE,\nsem runwayOptOut, sem conta de teste, não ARCHIVED
  opt SEGUINDO
    S -> DB: SELECT follows WHERE follower = eu AND status = ACEITO
  end
  S -> S: escopo (WorldRegions.of(country)) + facetas + filtros
  S -> HR: findByEntityTypeAndEntityIdInAndAlgorithmVersion(SCHEME, ids, v2)
  HR -> DB: SELECT hype_scores
  S -> S: runwayOrder(ranking) · corta no Top 100 · lote offset/limit (≤ 24)
  loop cada look do lote
    S -> S: look(scheme, viewer, hype) → mannequin(owner, peças, viewer)
    S -> DB: SELECT user_preferences (sexo, pele, porte do manequim)
    S -> AV: forMannequin(ownerId, viewerId)
    AV -> DB: SELECT user_avatars_3d
    AV --> S: avatar (público ou do próprio dono) | vazio
  end
  S --> C: {date, nextUpdate, totalToday, total, ranking, applied,\nbatch, looks[], table[≤100], facets, you, algorithmVersion}
  C --> FE: 200
  FE -> FE: RunwayScene (3D) ou RunwayFallback (2D)\n+ tabela com HypeBadge / RunwayHype
end
U -> FE: próximo lote
FE -> C: GET /api/explorer/runway?…&offset=12
== Sair (ou voltar) da Passarela ==
U -> FE: Configurações → "Desfilar meu Look do Dia"
FE -> FE: PATCH /api/me/profile {runwayOptOut}
note right of FE: PreferencesController → PreferencesService.updateProfile\n(users.runway_opt_out)
@enduml
